  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9d0d68fdf47ec2d6733fd55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的制服是订做的☆\r\n尺寸特大喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0549d8ba02a8e4d031db24444f3e2af0b305d6088f333c7f98d65116be7d36f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:197f753737afe6123e39c24e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想让大家看见\r\nbuono的表演啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a64b28b35088e3d3a520987587ad50b34093d2dc770a6a7a5117719c62c4929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee05689b00729ac4cf33a2d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会穿上这套服装，\r\n将大大的满足献给大家喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6748e1117fc8c0f42baa825e849b0d5522796face2685d4ff0db1596d3d9415f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:568ea8563517082181162f85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好大吃一顿吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3317d9297a75c7cd5bb9a54f2a5466c6f804e091dc9568ea81fa22795b17f105",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf1ac4d3d00a06ff79700ac6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽管变得大大的吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "903d1ca09750b7bc6e21d9b4f718eeec5c39b617d3f5285900ff6add5767d4ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22c0f27213149c2bd5b42fcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おでかけか、の～んびりか…\r\nどう過ごそうかな～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7f362c327f0b826027c68ef7593b3072d565c2673dd81572c25c0a1d3f90c9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e5381d1208cc3f9c2d99b92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつも行く服屋さんはね、\r\nおっきくてかわいい服だらけなんだ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e23ec7db9976ac8378eda07efeb05d3cbbd69138c5423f2f3957c4b2c6df791",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79a82a261a2e1808653f5aac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为穿上可爱的制服，\r\n每天都感觉buono喔～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "711e85810d8842200756afcaff7492b8b1f88af7b52074fc62a74c688ff064e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3853582cfe7b0372363caa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇～好可爱！\r\n让人忍不住想跳起舞来～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "07cae2a091a5df8adccc56cfabcc40f74f692de6a7fa962b2b1a8bee627fbe51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6404cf2f43d3c176d343d7fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在比赛中，为大家烹调出\r\nbuono精神☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "570da54dc67b5c28051901dd68eebe79ebf50b5119178874529187a016add6d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89c98146992d0a3800e8e8e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的制服是订做的☆\r\n尺寸特大喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0549d8ba02a8e4d031db24444f3e2af0b305d6088f333c7f98d65116be7d36f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db2735b720f67b0225ab640e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想让大家看见\r\nbuono的表演啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a64b28b35088e3d3a520987587ad50b34093d2dc770a6a7a5117719c62c4929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0120beac6fc2454a0297d333",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会穿上这套服装，\r\n将大大的满足献给大家喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6748e1117fc8c0f42baa825e849b0d5522796face2685d4ff0db1596d3d9415f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d481be5e4f1324c505014482",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好大吃一顿吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3317d9297a75c7cd5bb9a54f2a5466c6f804e091dc9568ea81fa22795b17f105",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb4850a67f552f18a40eca46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽管变得大大的吧──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "903d1ca09750b7bc6e21d9b4f718eeec5c39b617d3f5285900ff6add5767d4ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da662020a14c9cb7007126ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了ー♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "59572b4ce4ecc2b7365b2d9e4f45a50210336356bdc98daebcf36148ecdcbf9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6776bae7f846921812f5268",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起加油，\r\n用全力对决吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "530c451d40296d4cbe142f7ccb932eb73e0a739d25925ce46e12d6f2a8a11902",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e38aad50534e8b0e27945997",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好～使出全力～！\r\n我不会输的～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "512ad6d8a1ee67ee08bb0cb7767e5abed22a9e43c556c881c7e4a1072e1c61bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d32a01c5620ee54fb3d77c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你吃早餐了吗？\r\n还没吃的话，我请你吃\r\n我的特制早餐喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b2c9714643d8fc97044c344006cb23e5c0867b4132f21392fc048e8caca2c1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d09d127d389b2a72c74363a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一醒来，会先做个\r\n大大的四股踏～\r\n有时候会把睡衣撑破就是了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6403653cd721c788e8d3f389386c9a60c1e317285c6e672e8ccaedcd36c6d4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44d6a0f8e81f81f5c55a72c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中午了～大家一起吃的话，\r\n料理会变得更加更加buono喔～\r\n训练员也一起吃吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcc46aed03be99f893402f06a6cb4f3b19c8a6d8c31012a294a79a2add33dd92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd5e758c713a2f670cae0d85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多该去把点心\r\n发给大家了～不介意的话，\r\n训练员也一起去吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6e3565fcdd9671a0fbc8d8b4d39764a7ee2c22e9b4d1d815d4421683dd3a766",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31ebf8e1c9de996570c0dc16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇……嗯～现在先刻意\r\n打个大大的呵欠，\r\n把睡意都抛开～！呼哇～～啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0716cb89386a4142dd1b6e06ff6c6215ece378d061c6c1a6c6726a7216e56d27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:884e82c4ad780ec4c71a6247",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我夜宵做太多了。\r\n火锅、饭团、烫青菜……\r\n你喜欢什么，就拿去吃喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c9c48e6f104de9cf1d5a33111bc3a872d5e2fb6b931bf8d065cd5fe86c3fad7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5569f465e3d1957c34e18efd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了动植物不断成长茁壮的\r\n季节了呢～大家都长得\r\n又高又大吧～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "aef639ed425b8731ae2334e2711fc1e2377a3c137ace778b58a27b8473af2674",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cb479f817bccb6d6020b264",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "毕竟是夏天嘛。就出门张罗\r\n因应夏季派对的食材吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "565670066ecda7554c662ec7740644530850bd906a161d665ead3f96ce4a116a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:141f06f490b1b7621fa315b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了食欲之秋～♪\r\n为了享受到许许多多的buono，\r\n我想了一堆菜色喔～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7b44f6644b215d6d364a5a5f39db3251b3b85d4d8691fd14a490940a79a260a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c2c21bf39a62a65986a69a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起滚雪球，\r\n如果能做出一个比校舍\r\n更大的雪人就太buono了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "adff70e2f07081890492b4861aec6896f971bd9aab14d2c2b37b2d4242ad6cbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad022b707b8deb8b8e35167a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a37ba7702f90b8f9a203f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有时候会跟小光玩\r\n胡萝卜超人的游戏～我扮成搭档\r\n跟火锅怪人的机率大概一半一半～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d98ef8964df281bcf6ec5bfc25b6bcf517131ff45d4b46427345bdcd0817ec2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32e100dba745a557fc88b806",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "采珠的格局非常大呢～\r\n我也要更加追求buono的\r\n可能性喔～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "65bcff9e700b80a5bfd1cb31e945cc38d013aac8cda1ee657f09acf7c0e0a568",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e3c86c60ad0ff7939835706",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟大树要一起办一场\r\n地道的烤肉～\r\n大块的肉既狂野又buono♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb5d81b1aee7f4ec662645183d755ad481a82669f9b58cc03b6145e98c8daf33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42b093a391053a2614162082",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为意大利人常常使用海产嘛。\r\n我家的餐厅也要到\r\n各地鱼场去决定采购来源☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c56dfbe6c8ef2804a32bb20a3f33cd3a77bcb001c075c6fc962f9c90aa635d8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18121d5bba3f045e9d3794c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凡事都是越大越好。\r\nL号比M号好，\r\n家庭号又比L号更好☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b227a2947ddf7b3623607acb7486731c28fc5b046bc5b2358b78dc465a4a5bf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:108fe7c09a992986d83410a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要在大舞台\r\n将buono的舞姿献给大家～♪\r\n这样也是「相扑锅」喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1cf73f8eb35de0c8204ab010f69a685f78fd703265e7987c9152bc7d69345a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:919cb7a185a408ef73994ec1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管演唱会还是火锅，事前准备\r\n都很重要呢。拼命练习之后，\r\n让大家看到很香的表演吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba6040771bc26080250adcb2896a9046225c06da0c0e8e2abdb71a44857389bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cec663fcef0d2e76dc1449c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要全力奋战，将buono的意念\r\n传递给大家☆这套服装\r\n完全符合我的愿望喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "0691ffcb88da1e8c0b2863b2a1961ac8570138f07a8e9130600ec44ca50c4183",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:682d17d5bf8353cc40545b59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么～明天要准备什么\r\n点心呢～如果这件衣服上\r\n有你想吃的，就指出来吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "efc25a3b8f9862776eccc0131172fd194446bb33bf4cd5749ddfa575cbac17a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6f7c45344f1334590791bdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上吃粥也不错呢～\r\n里面再加蔬菜和肉跟高汤……\r\n呃，哎呀？变成火锅了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf18fc102244810782220a1f4f6a2fefcbda441f28e202a1a809af10fa4de672",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d0ebdab2743a6652080de15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我怕有些人没吃到午餐，\r\n所以总是多带一些\r\n点心在身上～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2af6c126b2b9e5ad41376e52812b3eedeb3b090afe8e56222fa8a56ca65d38aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e271ba468eb00d51f4894d08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前我看到了很大的流星喔～\r\n为了那稍纵即逝的瞬间，\r\n平常就得预备好远大的愿望才行☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "06d60037f4d16aff8325645b644166b78c3b1d54ff06f0d22f179de48cfff30f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edb146354bf0f46029c5c65e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等待已久的赏花季节♪\r\n准备好大大的方型便当盒，\r\n大家一起去赏花吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f50199ed303b17c9624e50302dbaad4f47b1f7fc0fa6c1c9428019a8dbd23797",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a54fc48c25bf92fbcf372799",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天都热死了呢～如果能在\r\n宽阔的地方尽情游泳就buono了～\r\n……好～去海边吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "056d19ff6ebcd8b5daff0b248d5006a4042ffcaf1f34a294d8837a39b38f814e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23eba9b64345958f6248b8ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天有很多很适合煮火锅的\r\nbuono菇类喔～♪\r\n一起去采集野菇吧。Go go☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d85dd3462f125c00a09f227435fb680ef60f440662b51f83a5373806b720a39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5424eaea459ceb8b3a3a4e80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火锅的季节到咯～！\r\n在寒冷的日子吃热呼呼的火锅，\r\n就更buono了呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "53777386dadb9924121c3e01819c557354f4d954a7ad1946c40d0fc2978b8557",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0660e3c9807b83944b12da0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好～今天也卯足干劲上吧～！\r\n不管要做什么训练，我都会完成喔～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "647d56429aee9a136cbf2b02a95f26e9b282f06d08379113e4e9f2185ad6310b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d95388cd25f9c87c295212f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "がんばりま～す！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1450f6e7ba62725a6bb4dc5eefc643d3240b989478037527af28ce5e8e9246b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbfbb8f9efb2c42d93941f2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "饮料的准备无懈可击喔。\r\n当然，用来补充营养的\r\n点心也一样～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4db18e8833d18c19137d3b2ea6115d1ae99372a5e39b3fab958602dc0595c38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:855fbba5bdd3a53c4e8de2e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要让力量持续成长，\r\nbuono的精神就能传递出去！\r\n只能努力去做了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b15ec4139dfccf02daece8d1d72a2f6ae034ade137c43f57ebca9846ec3249bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c0a4112cbac3b23332fdcc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在训练员来之前，\r\n我都做着四股踏在等你喔～♪\r\n下半身的柔软度已经完美了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "56b5988aeb52a27daf6bce382bfb1ba187550249c61b68d686183473effe6c45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43a02733e8af121c75c9eb30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每一天我都要全力以赴喔～！\r\n所以说，训练员，\r\n麻烦你对我大喊「上吧」☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "095fe208eef97ce9596ca78303e40f1616d300a20431e7744d69ea62b2eeedec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:693270d650e26143bece6b23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想成为能够承受大家全力的\r\n竞速界横纲～☆\r\n训练员，请多指教♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b8bd9df96d3b135b7c80815fb93e203d8ca059e2346c89358da2ae49adac898",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbd090d5cf7917bf33729057",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想让训练员获得好多好多\r\nbuono精神☆\r\n我会加油喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6adcc95b67b6aa16810e1464a1652ac5bb72d09a98014b0f3916a251506d725",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84187165b68b4239f25f6678",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大海是美味的宝库喔～！\r\n呵呵呵～我现在就想着\r\n要做晚餐，想到手痒了呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1cc5912709899b68042cd3b3275c066e6cc2aed8be9582d6337912d8ec7b093",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c42d63b730f267cbce0a11d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我成为「真正的相扑火锅」了呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "79b0108e93ea28c62f13db6104c6ff682a5f48fb30db7b831072e0d026524e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:808676b3abb23d4e6e70a5a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "两人的味道合起来，就成了最赞的buono咯☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1bd584946e60f2fd713e2fad5db1f9d4e092ae2404e20cfd1474b1efed47123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d1fb17ef3d76fd05ec594e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会变得更大更大喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "272971807d0229e05d8ab6ccaf88e6a86032fbdfd7f1447d797f5c3af5096654",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff81a0c7f1c685c9f39b99aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Buono是没有极限的喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46d31f2314d820f069f510d6e63b88107e3792370c70fb0eed30246584d62bce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:866f1099405722aa5974d2f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是菱曙哦～♪Buono buono☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1c45fdec60d8b66ab8fa84275d582bc6f363136e4a8d1dbf036482b06ed7e5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d889c5882c215ada6ab89cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了让大家都感受到buono精神！\r\n我会竭尽全力嘿咻嘿～咻♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "873b4d08df496cb2d5f748873753dd554230aa9291e4f8e8b72b516c7fc1e3cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79829afb4b001222e72a4679",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样就可以更努力帮忙了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e16a1679335e2335ac554c9b056d4c6a99f0e326873d915ad05dc16c2fa6bfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc4fea1cb62c1cf66fb17148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我的新菜色～！来，张开嘴～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "83a7b4830238165ea753506fec9fcfaf8834a5c99e7d4a4c6ccdecc05d3aa887",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1028",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7336e779bac0161cdd5bc8f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Fight、噢――的说～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e5ca511fdf897751c734aab69d8c4dccc930e6e7fab6e6ddae5b70ba63e8ba1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4b14f98629fb83136be67c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！\r\n我要成为美丽、强大、帅气的——\r\n真正的“城市女孩”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "936807d3194db9b6799f449429b176bf6ac69d34b6b868c46ba591d54918f891",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9483fe7cfe3ba260f864604",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきやンす。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a808e5f9fd6de7038fa13794f4060fb96af4ee1f644dd6f87a9299f9ae7da1ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ba94e649230a87b5098fb6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまです～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9166d09a46619f5075aa2db6e594128022d6b8043a5d57c907a7762949e2832",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28ff421574a446fc23af204e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为有着在老家的大家\r\n和训练员你支持着我。\r\n我一定会非常非常努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9450400f40ad774bcf2907e644a2dfe6272637e9c3674eda9395b6d2e04880a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c8c7f2eb237cab55f0f7fd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员你喜欢的东西是什么呢？\r\n……那、那个\r\n只是稍微参考一下……什么……的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b152dfd49ebcc969959c0e9947558ed7ada509faaaea4e6a41d37682bfc01ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2de328197fc876f1275635a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我老家的年糕汤……是酱油味的，\r\n然后配上四角型的年糕和鲑鱼子煮成的！\r\n训练员老家那边是怎样的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5a4d299b28b86349be354fa062917c5976ca4197e8a01055cbdf173242e7ca5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d484760b255648102e5bad16",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我用老家牧场生产的鲜奶油\r\n做了些生巧哦。\r\n只要用上这种鲜奶油做就会很好吃呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd98e157ee4ef19324e8b86e67c5996d977f78f01878dd0a6bebaebb5664444c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab8c2311fde24747f66631b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚给你的巧克力\r\n虽然不是什么漂亮玩意……但也是我非常努力做出来的\r\n所以等下就让我听听你的评价吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba8166cf9614a115f5edd9feca16f6f51db92b4ce23bf5210803c3e7c3b93df7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb6a46c280048c542f832a19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕节里装饰的短冊，五彩斑斓地很“上镜”呢！\r\n我也要像“城市女孩”一样，寄（自）拍一张了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5712f64cbcd1602d2715209c9b63436b77b7b81350776dabab2e754e951d0fd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aed8f3892eaa2b2b968e70d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节要打扮成什么样才好呢？\r\n外国的话是打扮成妖怪的样子吧？\r\n那座敷童子会好些吗……还是说河童呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "953deba9efff8e4fa776a978e149a3e063e80025d35838ef5e34c23d9bc74694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87adc397b0f7491509877a9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前我有和老家俱乐部的朋友们一起\r\n和附近福利院里的小孩子们\r\n开过圣诞会呢。那时真开心啊~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20df62539f16491b4883971db645a50ac6df2ed816cba1bf751f766b26a3fc58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8a5b2a2b467176f6a39038c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "街上的彩灯真漂亮呀！\r\n不过作为城里人的你又觉得\r\n怎么样呢……？请和我说说看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18b6118a0c5553186afafa1469e7f2f43c0461b919b3a580f1ae2fd31e52bacb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44b4a2ce53fc8c7607161fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做到啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "200fc70b8c71ecde45b8974d115c880ad70afdd85f022eed3da2540788ebedd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5279488e207d6c40013309bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家里人说着“过年的时候吃吧”，\r\n给我寄了一些生荞麦面来呢。\r\n要做些碗子荞麦面吃嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d068882c7263f25947e66087a049463c4e0795d2453cc4be733f169fb25610e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeac9aad0357ba9e4347b839",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy Birthday～tsu～……♪\r\ntsu……♪to～you～～♪\r\n恭、恭喜了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e06d6a38bd387992cf8883c11129fe11c005e4fe455e041567bd0c8ad41ea2a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10a13a089efd31160d5bd518",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我纠结了很久到底送你什么生日礼物才好……\r\n所以就为你准备了一场盛冈的小旅行！\r\n怎、怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1ede0b90891a34bce7f8821c57058a4283d5846d875cdf2879fbe924b77b14c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03716334caa70fe2db66de43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老家的大家给我寄来了好多\r\n用来庆祝生日的好吃的！\r\n可以的话要一起吃点吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d21117425c2873a655ba2d52e5078edfab9e1850aaeec37d3a18815756c76809",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "10013"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
